 "notes": "Page footnote: \"* Includes 4 persons (3 males and 1 female) enumerated in the United Provinces States.\" (asterisk on B. Total, United Provinces, 782*). Columns 782-784 carry two languages: Andamanese in the Provinces block and Burushaski in the States and Agencies block; they are given as two separate column entries with the same column numbers. Andamanese has no States figures printed and Burushaski no INDIA/Provinces figures, so INDIA = PROV + STATES cannot be checked for either (Andamanese INDIA 466 = PROV 466). Figures in the Gipsy, Others and B. Total columns are printed about one line below their row labels; rows were assigned by counting entries in sequence (italic Aden and Madras-States sub-rows confirm the alignment) and confirmed by sums. Unclassed Languages Total = Andamanese/Burushaski + Gipsy + Others in every row."
